      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a workaround, VRChat logs all joined instances into the output log file with \"[RoomManager] Joining \", so you can open the last output log in an editor and run a backwards+wrapped search for that string to find the world id and instance token string, then reconstruct a VRChat URL vrchat://launch?ref=vrchat.com&id=WORLD_ID_AND_INSTANCE_TOKEN, paste that into your browser and your VRChat should open and boot you directly into that instance again.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
