      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6180ae68bea5682298f525e2|full_name}: this is why I suggested a tiered approach/scaled model.\nI was worried the response would be “malicious users will abuse this”, so I considered a rebuttal to that. Also, being that VRChat answers to investors, I figured a pitch that indicates an ability to sustain an income, may be more likely to succeed. \nYou see, I’d love this feature to be available to all, but more accurately, I’d love this feature to exist at all. My suggestions were made with that in mind. \nBut you’re correct, everyone can get crashed. I do hope that if this feature is implemented that the number of crashers will reduce; they’ll be downgraded to an inconvenience instead of a day ruining event… and they’re more likely to be reported if the victim can pop back into the instance (with safety settings on) and then block and report the offending user!\nThank you for commenting. If you feel this is a worthy feature, please kindly help our voice be heard to the Dev’s and share this canny with your friends!!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
